# The live front page streams in behind a skeleton; the pager only appears
# once stories land, so the route waits for it before touching the bar.
wait-for 1 of
expect Ask
clean
shot hn-top
tap Saved
wait-for Nothing here yet
expect Its article is kept on this reader
clean
shot hn-saved
# Save keeps a story on the Saved list whether or not its own site lets the
# article be fetched; reading that article offline is in drive-live-article.kobo,
# because story sites rate-limit shared CI runners.
tap Top
wait-for 1 of
tap-id story-0
wait-for Save
clean
shot hn-thread
tap Save
# The article comes from the story's own site, which can take well over ten
# seconds on a shared runner; Saved shows once it is stored or has failed.
wait-idle 60000
wait-for Saved
tap Back
wait-for 1 of
tap Saved
expect-missing Nothing saved yet.
wait-for-id saved-menu-0
clean
shot hn-saved-list
# The Saved list is on the reader, not in memory, so it survives a restart.
restart
wait-for 1 of
tap Saved
wait-for-id saved-menu-0
clean
shot hn-saved-after-restart
tap Top
wait-for 1 of
scenario offline
# A live tab with no network says so as the whole screen, with Try again.
tap New
wait 9000
wait-for You're offline
expect Try again
clean
shot hn-new-offline
scenario normal
tap Try again
wait-for 1 of
# Page turns on a list go forward and back, and the bar says which page.
tap-id list-next
wait-for 2 of
clean
shot hn-new-page-2
tap-id list-back
wait-for 1 of
# Ask HN stories have no link, so the discussion offers no article.
tap Ask
wait-for 1 of
tap-id story-0
wait-for Discussion
expect-missing Read the article
expect Save
clean
shot hn-ask-thread
tap Back
wait-for 1 of
tap Show
wait-for 1 of
clean
shot hn-show
# A discussion folds a comment with its replies and opens it again, and its
# own pages turn.
tap Top
wait-for 1 of
tap-id story-0
maybe-tap-id fold-0
wait-idle
clean
shot hn-thread-folded
maybe-tap-id fold-0
wait-idle
tap-id thread-next
wait-for 2 of
clean
shot hn-thread-page-2
tap-id thread-back
wait-for 1 of
# Tapping Saved in the discussion takes it off the list again.
expect Saved
tap Saved
wait-for Save
tap Back
wait-for 1 of
tap Saved
wait-for Nothing saved yet
clean
shot hn-saved-emptied
# Taking a story off from its row menu, the other way to remove one.
tap Top
wait-for 1 of
tap-id story-1
wait-for Save
tap Save
# The article comes from the story's own site, which can take well over ten
# seconds on a shared runner; Saved shows once it is stored or has failed.
wait-idle 60000
wait-for Saved
tap Back
wait-for 1 of
tap Saved
wait-for-id saved-menu-0
tap-id saved-menu-0
wait-for Take off this list
clean
shot hn-saved-row-menu
tap Take off this list
wait-for Nothing saved yet
clean
